Subject: [PATCH] [TASK: gov-gha-primary-buildkite-deferred] Governance CI:
 GitHub Actions primario, status Buildkite differiti non sono gate di merge
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

OWNER DECISION 31/10/2026 (#586). La merge readiness (gate CI pr_flow_automation e controller, fonte unica
pr_automation_controller.is_deferred_buildkite_status) esclude dai blocker/pending i soli commit status della lane
Buildkite sospesa: StatusContext + context in {full-suite, overlap-check, pr-merge-readiness} + target buildkite.com.
Restano fra gli ignorati (warning se rossi). Il CheckRun overlap-check di GitHub Actions (required del ruleset)
resta bloccante; host contraffatti, CheckRun omonimi, context diversi o tipo sconosciuto bloccano (fail-closed).
Spec §0.11 e CLAUDE.md aggiornati; test PASS (18) e BLOCK (12 FAIL sul codice di main); mutazione
gov_buildkite_deferred_any_type. Ruleset, workflow e required check invariati. File di governance: merge owner.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
